  "summary": "",
  "preview": "",
  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"xiangqingchakan\"> \n <p style=\"text-indent:0.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">亲爱的</font><font face=\"宋体\">2026届毕业生同学们：</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">毕业的钟声即将敲响，大家即将背上行囊奔赴新的旅程。在告别校园之际，我们特别想和你们聊一聊</font><font face=\"宋体\">——关于那些陪伴了你整个校园时光的电子邮箱、云盘文件、统一身份认证账号，以及它们在你毕业后的“归宿”。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">为了更贴近同学们的实际需求，信息办举办此次座谈会，期待你从毕业生的视角，对学校信息化服务的改进建言献策。你的真实体验和宝贵建议，将帮助我们为未来的学弟学妹们打造更顺畅的离校体验。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">座谈会详情如下</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">一、校园邮箱的保留与使用</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">- 毕业后，校园邮箱能否继续保留使用？保留多久？</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">- 如果曾用校园邮箱注册了期刊投稿系统、个人重要平台账号，毕业后需要找回密码或接收邮件时该怎么办？</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">- 邮箱停用后，里面的邮件、附件等数据能否提前备份或迁移？</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">二、电子身份与账号管理</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">- 毕业离校后，统一身份认证账号何时注销？</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">- 直博、直硕的同学在双重电子身份同时有效的过渡期内，能否更方便地在各系统间迁移个人文件和数据？</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">- 如果毕业后还需要登录校内系统办理就业相关手续，账号能否申请临时延期？</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">三、云盘文件与共享数据</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">- 毕业离校后，云盘中的个人文件还能继续访问和下载吗？</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">- 如果曾将文件共享给其他在校同学，毕业后共享链接是否会失效？文件会不会因此丢失？</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">- 是否有更便捷的方式，让毕业生在离校前一键迁移或打包下载所有个人数据？</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">四、电子化离校流程</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">- 目前离校手续中有哪些环节仍需“纸质跑签”？推进全流程电子化的难点在哪里？</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">- 如何让离校手续更省心、更高效，真正做到“数据多跑路，同学少跑腿”？</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">本次专题讨论将聚焦毕业生关心的信息化服务话题。如果你在毕业离校过程中遇到了任何与信息化相关的问题或困惑，欢迎来现场聊聊</font><font face=\"宋体\">——你的每一个声音，都可能让未来的离校体验变得更好一点。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">我们等你来！</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:0.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">会议时间：</font></span></span></span></span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">6</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">月</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">26</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">日</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">周五</font> </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">13:30-15:00</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:0.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">参会地点：</font></span></span></span></span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">老环境楼</font><font face=\"宋体\">103会议室</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:0.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">座谈会报名方式</font></span></span></span></span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">：</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:0.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">座谈会报名截止时间</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">6</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">月</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">26</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">日</font><font face=\"宋体\">1</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">0</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">:00前</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:0.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:left blank 280.6000pt \"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">座谈会报名链接</font></span></span></span></span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">：</font></span></span></span> </span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:0.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><a href=\"/f/info/route?id=routeb1053035cce2434caec44e46ca8a0e5b\" target=\"_blank\"><u><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#0026e5\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-underline:single\"><font face=\"Calibri\">https://wenjuan.tsinghua.edu.cn/s/qyAFvm/#</font></span></span></span></span></u></a> </span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:0.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">座谈会报名二维码</font></span></span></span></span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">：</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:0.0000pt; text-align:left\"> </p> \n <div class=\"ckeditor-html5-img\" id=\"img1782347096669div\" style=\"text-align:center\"> \n  <img src=\"/b/ckeditor/downloadFiles?wjid=284_XXFB-FG_2026_LM_BM_284_BGTZ_1782347096117640ce6b749-ee46-49ea-810a-525c5d197137&dxid=LM_BM_284_BGTZ\" style=\"width: 100px; height: 100px; float: left;\">  \n </div> \n <p></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:0.0000pt; text-align:left\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:0.0000pt; text-align:left\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:0.0000pt; text-align:left\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:0.0000pt; text-align:left\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:0.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">报名联系人：刘一璇</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:0.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><font face=\"宋体\">联系电话：</font><font face=\"宋体\">62772587/13686407056</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n</div>",
  "contentText": "亲爱的 2026届毕业生同学们： 毕业的钟声即将敲响，大家即将背上行囊奔赴新的旅程。在告别校园之际，我们特别想和你们聊一聊 ——关于那些陪伴了你整个校园时光的电子邮箱、云盘文件、统一身份认证账号，以及它们在你毕业后的“归宿”。 为了更贴近同学们的实际需求，信息办举办此次座谈会，期待你从毕业生的视角，对学校信息化服务的改进建言献策。你的真实体验和宝贵建议，将帮助我们为未来的学弟学妹们打造更顺畅的离校体验。 座谈会详情如下 一、校园邮箱的保留与使用 - 毕业后，校园邮箱能否继续保留使用？保留多久？ - 如果曾用校园邮箱注册了期刊投稿系统、个人重要平台账号，毕业后需要找回密码或接收邮件时该怎么办？ - 邮箱停用后，里面的邮件、附件等数据能否提前备份或迁移？ 二、电子身份与账号管理 - 毕业离校后，统一身份认证账号何时注销？ - 直博、直硕的同学在双重电子身份同时有效的过渡期内，能否更方便地在各系统间迁移个人文件和数据？ - 如果毕业后还需要登录校内系统办理就业相关手续，账号能否申请临时延期？ 三、云盘文件与共享数据 - 毕业离校后，云盘中的个人文件还能继续访问和下载吗？ - 如果曾将文件共享给其他在校同学，毕业后共享链接是否会失效？文件会不会因此丢失？ - 是否有更便捷的方式，让毕业生在离校前一键迁移或打包下载所有个人数据？ 四、电子化离校流程 - 目前离校手续中有哪些环节仍需“纸质跑签”？推进全流程电子化的难点在哪里？ - 如何让离校手续更省心、更高效，真正做到“数据多跑路，同学少跑腿”？ 本次专题讨论将聚焦毕业生关心的信息化服务话题。如果你在毕业离校过程中遇到了任何与信息化相关的问题或困惑，欢迎来现场聊聊 ——你的每一个声音，都可能让未来的离校体验变得更好一点。 我们等你来！ 会议时间： 6 月 26 日 周五 13:30-15:00 参会地点： 老环境楼 103会议室 座谈会报名方式 ： 座谈会报名截止时间 6 月 26 日 1 0 :00前 座谈会报名链接 ： https://wenjuan.tsinghua.edu.cn/s/qyAFvm/# 座谈会报名二维码 ： 报名联系人：刘一璇 联系电话： 62772587/13686407056",
